{{also|baby-sitter|baby sitter}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|baby-sitter}}
* {{lb|en|rare}} {{l|en|baby sitter}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|baby|sitter|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈbeɪbiˌsɪtɚ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who [[care]]s for one or more babies or children for a short period of time in place of their [[guardian|legal guardian]]s.
#: ''My neighbor is sometimes a '''babysitter''' for other moms' children.''

